# Unreal Engine project .gitignore
#
# The rule of thumb: commit Source, Config, Content and Plugins. Everything
# else Unreal regenerates, and committing it is how UE repos end up at 20 GB.

# Generated / derived — all rebuildable
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# Generated by the editor on open, not source
*.sln
Makefile
CMakeLists.txt
.ignore

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Crash logs
Saved/Crashes/
Saved/Logs/

# Do NOT ignore these — they are the project
!Config/
!Content/
!Source/
!Plugins/
!*.uproject

*.slnx
Visual Studio 2022/
